  "claim": "In 2016 the movement that Tess Asplund protested in the viral image of her with her fist in the air disbanded.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Tess Asplund. Sentence: Tess Asplund, born 1974, is a Swedish activist who gained attention following her protest against neo-Nazis in Borlänge, Sweden.\nPage: Tess Asplund. Sentence: David Lagerlof is the photographer of the viral image of Asplund, which shows her facing uniformed members of the Swedish Nordic Resistance Movement with her fist in the air.\nPage: Nordic Resistance Movement. Sentence: It had a branch in Denmark before it was disbanded for inactivity in 2016.",
