        "original_id": "06d6c2d2-5fec-5e07-a854-de04000ac743",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tess Asplund, David Lagerlof\n- Organizations: Nordic Resistance Movement\n- Places: Borlänge, Sweden, Denmark\n- Roles: activist, photographer\n- Events: protest against neo-Nazis, branch disbandment\n\nFacts:\n- Tess Asplund was born in 1974 and is a Swedish activist.\n- Tess Asplund gained attention after protesting against neo-Nazis in Borlänge, Sweden.\n- David Lagerlof photographed the viral image of Tess Asplund facing uniformed members of the Nordic Resistance Movement with her fist raised.\n- The Nordic Resistance Movement had a branch in Denmark before that branch was disbanded for inactivity in 2016.",
